Package: NicEuc
Title: Generate and Visualize Nested Sampling Points with Spatial Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Mitra", "Ghotbi", email = "mitra.ghotbi@gmail.com", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: 
    The NicEuc package facilitates the generation and visualization of
    nested sampling points for ecological and spatial studies. It supports
    hierarchical designs (Rings -> Plots -> Cells -> Samples) and integrates
    spatial autocorrelation analysis using Moran's I. The package provides
    tools for geospatial transformations, species assignment, and both
    static (ggplot2) and interactive (Leaflet) visualizations.
